    "text": "The correct code for stability, of oxidation states for given cations is<br />\rI. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> II. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />\rIII. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> IV. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />\rV. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> VI. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
